#: applications/luci-app-ksmbd/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ksmbd.js:62
msgid ""
"This is the content of the file '/etc/ksmbd/ksmbd.conf.template' from which "
"your ksmbd configuration will be generated. Values enclosed by pipe symbols "
"('|') should not be changed. They get their values from the 'General "
"Settings' tab."
msgstr ""
"Dette er innholdet i filen '/etc/ksmbd/ksmbd.conf.template' som ksmbd-"
"konfigurasjonen din vil bli generert fra. Verdier omsluttet av rørsymboler "
"('|') skal ikke endres. De får verdiene sine fra fanen 'Generelle "
"innstillinger'."

